        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ca31c88f-d15e-407b-8407-231f1b068402).Image",
        "Description": "47 has been captured and needs to escape.  After picking the lock on his handcuffs, he gets the chance to take out Zayden, and what he does from there is your call.  The chef near the exit is a spy for Zaydan&apos;s forces, so she must be eliminated to avoid leaving a trail.  Skip town before your execution is scheduled to start.\r\r(You should start in Zaydan&apos;s compound and acquire the Prisoner disguise before Zaydan reaches the room for the first time)",
